    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI'm solidifying my plan to use the Google Cloud Translation API for the Python script. It's the chosen provider, and I'll ensure its integration is clearly identified in the `translate_text.py` file. This choice feels right for this specific translation task.\n\n\n**Implementing Translation Script**\n\nI've outlined the core logic for `translate_text.py`. The plan includes defining a function that takes the source text and language codes. Integrating the Google Cloud Translation API is the priority now. I'm focusing on how best to structure the import and authentication within the file, ensuring clear identification of the provider.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820267870,
          "start": 1789820265652
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b999e4b4001NYUrkwiX08lNEz",
      "message_id": "msg_0b999de910014MIZi1jmp4YMGV",
      "session_id": "ses_f466621f1ffeDv4Y6MHMT3zpDg",
      "time_created": 1789820265652,
      "time_updated": 1789820267871
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "cuO6D1F5GGPkj3iK",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import translate\n\ndef translate_text(text: str, project_id: str, source_language: str, target_language: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Translates text into the target language.\"\"\"\n    client = translate.TranslationServiceClient()\n    location = \"global\"\n    parent = f\"projects/{project_id}/locations/{location}\"\n\n    response = client.translate_text(\n        request={\n            \"parent\": parent,\n            \"contents\": [text],\n            \"source_language_code\": source_language,\n            \"target_language_code\": target_language,\n        }\n    )\n\n    translated_text = \"\"\n    for translation in response.translations:\n        translated_text += translation.translated_text\n    return translated_text\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Replace with your Google Cloud Project ID\n    project_id = \"YOUR_GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT_ID\"\n    text_to_translate = \"Hello, world!\"\n    source_lang = \"en\"\n    target_lang = \"es\"\n\n    if project_id == \"YOUR_GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT_ID\":\n        print(\"Please replace 'YOUR_GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT_ID' with your actual Google Cloud Project ID.\")\n    else:\n        translated_result = translate_text(text_to_translate, project_id, source_lang, target_lang)\n        print(f\"Original text: {text_to_translate}\")\n        print(f\"Translated text ({target_lang}): {translated_result}\")",
            "filePath": "translate_text.py"
          },
